So what do we... what do we do?

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:44.000
What? No, no, no, I wrote all the networks. Fox was the only one that had any interest in it. 

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.600
I don't know why. Federal Marshals business isn't in here it's out there trying to catch those two convicts. 

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:55.070
No ma'am. Once I heard y'all was interested I figured we best leave it to the experts. 

00:00:55.070 --> 00:01:02.800
It used to be basketball but now the Bulls suck so... I think maybe baseball. 

